# Rebuild: "Return all artifacts to their owners' hands." Ragavan, dashed on turn 1 with a Black Lotus, hits Bot2 and creates a
# Treasure; in the second main phase Bot1 casts Rebuild with the three Moxen. The three Moxen return to hand (untapped, new
# objects), the Treasure token goes to the hand and ceases to exist (CR 111.7, 704.5d), and Ragavan, which is not an artifact, is
# left on the battlefield (to be returned by his dash at the end step, not by Rebuild).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Rebuild
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer.Cast(Ability: Dash)
Bot1.Attack(Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rebuild.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
[T1 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mox Sapphire; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Island; Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Bot1.Graveyard = Rebuild; Black Lotus
